<title>SRI LANKA: Kelani Valley nine-month net up.</title>
<headline>Kelani Valley nine-month net up.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unaudited results of Kelani Valley Plantations Ltd for the nine months to September 30, 1996.</p>
<p>(in millions of rupees unless stated):</p>
<p>		   9 months 1996	  9 months 1995</p>
<p>    Turnover	 579.09	vs	 493.72</p>
<p>    Net profit	42.28	vs	  18.46</p>
<p>NOTE - Kelani Valley Plantations is one of six state firms privatised in 1995.</p>
<p>-- Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
